{"4411000": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Amer: The Chase Hit and Run", "steam_appid": 4411000, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4411000/extras/ef1d92ec2c63c01264a7a04821d10c9a.avif?t=1772010508\" width=952 height=108 /></span><strong><i>Run, drive &amp; race! Find wild surprises with Amer , </i></strong>jump into a huge open world where the whole city is yours. In Amer Hit N Run, you’re free to explore different neighborhoods, from busy streets to wide open desert. Drive cars, run on foot, or just roam around as missions and side activities appear all over the map. With smooth controls and great visuals, there’s always something new to find.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4411000/extras/1aaaa9bea6f709dfe1f3e9bcb57c787d.poster.avif?t=1772010508\" width=1170 height=1316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4411000/extras/1aaaa9bea6f709dfe1f3e9bcb57c787d.webm?t=1772010508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4411000/extras/1aaaa9bea6f709dfe1f3e9bcb57c787d.mp4?t=1772010508\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4411000/extras/57c30cc5adb7ba0107e1e86c2848215b.avif?t=1772010508\" width=952 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>From pizza delivery to chasing chickens! Play all missions &amp; enjoy the fun</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The city is full of quick and fun missions you can jump into anytime. Deliver pizzas, drive a taxi, or chase down chickens to earn cash and level up. No waiting, no limits , just pick a job and get moving. Every mission keeps the action fresh and the streets busy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4411000/extras/d2580ebc2bada9b54f453dcfcd80b5e3.poster.avif?t=1772010508\" width=1170 height=936 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4411000/extras/d2580ebc2bada9b54f453dcfcd80b5e3.webm?t=1772010508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4411000/extras/d2580ebc2bada9b54f453dcfcd80b5e3.mp4?t=1772010508\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4411000/extras/264766af5f622e21a7c66d3e80a1b433.avif?t=1772010508\" width=952 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a break from missions and dive into crazy mini-games all over the city. Race through streets, jump into tank battles, or grab a paintball gun for some messy fun. There’s always something wild to try, and every mini-game adds a new way to play in the open world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4411000/extras/5bb1d2416f6323dcae54ea602894bcab.poster.avif?t=1772010508\" width=1170 height=570 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4411000/extras/5bb1d2416f6323dcae54ea602894bcab.webm?t=1772010508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4411000/extras/5bb1d2416f6323dcae54ea602894bcab.mp4?t=1772010508\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4411000/extras/2f6800568e1ab71330a785e06cfd55e3.avif?t=1772010508\" width=952 height=103 /></span><br>Treat yourself! Buy a luxury home &amp; live like a king! Make money your way in the city. Earn cash from missions and mini-games, then spend it on houses, cars, and your own businesses. Upgrade your rides, customize your cars and show everyone who’s really running the streets. Being rich has never been this fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4411000/extras/ddef59eb6e9ef57cca687327a47ac7ec.poster.avif?t=1772010508\" width=1170 height=570 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4411000/extras/ddef59eb6e9ef57cca687327a47ac7ec.webm?t=1772010508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4411000/extras/ddef59eb6e9ef57cca687327a47ac7ec.mp4?t=1772010508\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4411000/extras/244f1d9a5f4a628c25399e6c052b0b55.avif?t=1772010508\" width=952 height=103 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit the city shops and change your style anytime. Grab new outfits, mix and match, and make Amer look exactly how you want. Your wardrobe lets you show off your personality while roaming the open world.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4411000/extras/00d30585d6a6c3857de10503cf8bb7ad.poster.avif?t=1772010508\" width=1170 height=658 ><source 